  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Humanitarian Localisation Baseline for Ukraine: Progress report</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is co-funding the NGO RC&#x2019;s 2025 and 2026 report into the state of localisation in Ukraine alongside Christian Aid and Action Aid. The understanding of humanitarian localisation in the Ukrainian humanitarian response remains a key policy and practice concern for donors and humanitarian actors. This progress report follows the 2024 baseline report published by NGO RC which was widely shared within the sector, the report is hosted on the ICVA website here: https://www.icvanetwork.org/uploads/2023/09/A-Humanitarian-Localization-Baseline-for-Ukraine.pdf.</narrative>
  </description>
